# Project specific R8 rules. AGP combines every keep rule file in src/main/keepRules and passes them to R8.
# See https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# The Anthropic Java SDK needed -dontwarn com.google.auto.value.AutoValue because opentelemetry-api
# referenced that compile-only annotation. The SDK is gone, and this file has no keep rules.
